14	 * different {@code telephone}. Such an owner is still created, but flagged: {@code possibleDuplicate} is
15	 * set true and {@code possibleDuplicateOf} to the matching existing owner's id (the lowest id when more
16	 * than one matches). When there is no match the owner is flagged {@code possibleDuplicate} false. The
17	 * new owner is still unsaved, so it is not among the owners iterated here and cannot match itself.
18	 */
